<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/40/msa@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in the case where the new accounts are made up ending before the corresponding day, thirty days before the end of the new accounts; or"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/40/msa@> .
