<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/40/msa@/~chp_II__cl_6__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (10A) subseksyen yang berikut: “(10B) The management expenses incurred for the basis period for a year of assessment under — (a) subsubparagraph (9)(b)(iii)(B) or (C) shall be determined in accordance with the following formula: AxC B where A is the total amount of gross income for that period referred to in subparagraph (9)(a)(iii) excluding the amount of gross income in respect of wakalah fee; B is the total amount of gross income for that period referred to in subparagraph (9)(a)(iii) excluding the amount of gross income in respect of wakalah fee for commission; and C is the total management expenses incurred under subparagraph (9)(b)(iii); or (b) subsubparagraph (10)(b)(iii)(B) or (C) shall be determined in accordance with the following formula: AxC B where A is the total amount of gross income for that period referred to in subparagraph (10)(a)(iii) excluding the amount of gross income in respect of wakalah fee; B is the total amount of gross income for that period referred to in subparagraph (10)(a)(iii) excluding the amount of gross income in respect of wakalah fee for commission; and C is the total management expenses incurred under subparagraph (10)(b)(iii).”. Pindaan seksyen 107c"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/40/msa@> .
